{"title":"Thursday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/926026913/0/marginalrevolution~Thursday-assorted-links.html","date":1760033646000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2025/10/08/books/jonathan-lear-dead.html\" target=\"_blank\">Jonathan Lear obituary</a> (NYT).</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.spirithalloween.com/product/adult-reciprocal-tariffs-parody-costume/288359.uts\" target=\"_blank\">Parody costume markets in everything</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.22818\" target=\"_blank\">Can Large Language Models develop gambling addiction?</a> They just need to be reminded that the Washington Wizards do not have a single player in the NBA top 130.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.construction-physics.com/p/why-are-so-many-pedestrians-killed?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=104058&amp;post_id=175619659&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjo0NzYxLCJwb3N0X2lkIjoxNzU2MTk2NTksImlhdCI6MTc2MDAxMTkwOSwiZXhwIjoxNzYyNjAzOTA5LCJpc3MiOiJwdWItMTA0MDU4Iiwic3ViIjoicG9zdC1yZWFjdGlvbiJ9.5PBc8-UHlLdNqtn3OcG0iM8f0qqqoLc0I0PPuX8dkZw&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Why are so many pedestrians killed by cars in the US?</a></p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/DanielKral1/status/1975900747192799511\" target=\"_blank\">French spending on pensions</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/deanwball/status/1976260051351343195?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\">Important Dean Ball post on rare earths</a>.</p>\r\n<p><span>7. There is a new The Free Press new books podcast, hosted by Shilo